data emit_on_demand_family_cadence_note: String = "The seven emit-on-demand family aggregates (9 witness families: add, field_access, complement, match, loop, fold_closure, meet_join, variant_construct, classical_not_ingested) enroll on this nightly Wet cadence 2026-07-21: each emits real Rust, cargo-builds under the admitted build_workspace_grant envelope, runs the native binary, and compares against the interpreted oracle. Enrolled after the 2026-07-20 regression proved the class was invisible to CI (test/claim/execution/ excluded from hermetic discovery AND offline roster - the enrolled-but-never-run coverage-by-illusion class): the sorted_fields interner-order bug broke all 9 families' wet legs and nothing red-ed. This cadence is the rot-detector. Per-PR stays hermetic; the full CI-on-v2 cutover (P6) additionally needs the is_hermetic blanket refusal in emit_host_run_transport replaced by the Admitted verdict (effect-grants seam) plus the content-keyed result store so builds amortize."

